 "remarks": "Brand New & Quietly Secluded! Discover refined modern luxury surrounded by nature at 68 Richards Lane. Privately nestled on 1.05 wooded acres, this exceptional new construction residence is crafted by Able Construction, a seasoned local builder with HOBI Awards. Offering over 6,800 square feet across four thoughtfully designed levels, the home showcases 9-foot ceilings, custom millwork, oversized windows and doors, and a striking architectural staircase featuring floating-style wood treads, exposed steel, and sleek black metal railings. Expansive walls of glass frame serene woodland views, filling the interior with natural light. At the heart of the home, a stunning chef's kitchen features quartzite countertops, a 48\" Sub-Zero refrigerator, 48\" Wolf range, two Cove dishwashers, and beverage fridge, a spacious walk-in butler's pantry and stylish bar make entertaining effortless. The luxurious primary retreat offers a spa-inspired bath with radiant-heated floors. A flexible office or guest suite and a walkout lower level with lounge, additional bedroom, full bath, and space for fitness, recreation, or a home theater provide exceptional versatility. A 24kW Generac whole-house generator adds peace of mind. A rare combination of architectural sophistication, wooded privacy, and everyday convenience, just minutes from downtown New Canaan, Waveny Park, shopping, dining, schools, and Metro-North service to NYC.",
